---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import { ArrowRight, ArrowUpRight } from '@lucide/astro';
import PortalLayout from '../layouts/PortalLayout.astro';
import HomeOverview from '../components/HomeOverview.astro';
import HardwareArchitecture from '../components/HardwareArchitecture.astro';
import FlowWorkbench from '../components/FlowWorkbench.astro';
import QramDiagram from '../components/QramDiagram.astro';
import aimdPreview from '../assets/guides/aimd/06-molecule-evolution.png';
import '../styles/flow-home.css';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<PortalLayout>
  <HomeOverview />
  <HardwareArchitecture />

  <section class="flow-home-system" id="workflow" aria-labelledby="system-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="flow-section-heading"><div><p class="flow-section-kicker"><span>02</span> 工作流程</p><h2 id="system-title">指定每一步使用的设备，PivotQ 负责安排执行。</h2><p>按任务需要组合 CPU 预处理、GPU 模型计算与 QPU 电路执行。性能工具根据任务描述和设备模型估算耗时。</p></div><a class="flow-text-link" href={`${base}docs/`}>查看工作流程 <ArrowUpRight size={18} /></a></div>
      <FlowWorkbench />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="flow-home-applications" id="applications" aria-labelledby="applications-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="flow-section-heading"><div><p class="flow-section-kicker"><span>03</span> 示例与原理</p><h2 id="applications-title">水分子 AIMD 与 QRAM 示例</h2><p>从水分子的能量、受力再到轨迹演示，再看量子地址怎样读取存储位。</p></div></div>
      <div class="flow-application-grid">
        <a class="flow-application" href={`${base}examples/aimd/`}><div class="flow-application-copy"><span class="flow-app-index">模型与轨迹</span><h3>水分子 AIMD</h3><p>先理解原子位置、势能、力与下一帧的关系，再查看量子电路和另一份已保存的轨迹。</p><span class="flow-application-link">查看电路与轨迹 <ArrowRight size={18} /></span></div><div class="flow-application-media flow-application-media-aimd"><Image src={aimdPreview} alt="水分子轨迹与总能量曲线的计算工作台截图" loading="lazy" /></div></a>
        <a class="flow-application" href={`${base}examples/qram/`}><div class="flow-application-copy"><span class="flow-app-index">本地教学程序</span><h3>QRAM</h3><p>从两位地址找到四个存储位置中的一格，用 PivotQ 构造电路，演示固定地址与叠加地址的理想查询。</p><span class="flow-application-link">查看寻址原理 <ArrowRight size={18} /></span></div><div class="flow-application-media flow-application-media-qram"><QramDiagram compact /></div></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="flow-home-next" aria-labelledby="next-title"><div class="container flow-home-next-inner"><div><p class="flow-section-kicker"><span>04</span> 操作教程</p><h2 id="next-title">按步骤运行水分子示例</h2><p>教程介绍怎样编译电路、估算用时、提交 CPU 数值模拟，再查看分子轨迹。</p></div><a class="flow-button flow-button-primary" href={`${base}docs/aimd/`}>打开 AIMD 教程 <ArrowUpRight size={18} /></a></div></section>
</PortalLayout>
